      "body": "\n<p>\n\n</p><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:06e2c1ee3389e0cd6046965ec29668529a3dd437d8adb7986672c2aeb62f1922\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:49c259db6a9e8834856b2e6f0f80d2f19a72f7db6c946a7fe5a7d02d50b6eaa3\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div><div><br/></div><div>AI 결합되면 개쩌는 사기꾼이었을듯</div></div>\n<p></p>\n",
